The bounded trace identified the issue: selecting only `SPEC.select-words` also removed the loop claim from the circularity set, so the prover unrolled the symbolic string indefinitely. I’m now running the required full spec with both claims enabled; this preserves the loop invariant as an auxiliary circularity for the entry theorem.
exec
